<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">2CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">2CO - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Itek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Icɛr iyiŋɛ irɛ bǝn Bulus, ne shar ayou Yesɔ Kristi nǝ tanyɛmɛ yi Arik, bǝn Timoti zumɔr,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Gar bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik ne kɔrɔntiya, bǝn amunya bɔbɔk abǝ Akaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Iki didik yi na Arik ben sik susun rɛ ben Arik Tetɛɛ mɔr ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi amɔr bǝ nak yi min.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arik ne nek aneshir sik asusun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Igbar asak nak yi Arik, ben Tetɛɛ ayou Yesɔ Kristi amɔr Ŋgɔŋ, Tetɛɛ ne lɔ susun ben ne nek sik susun. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Waŋ ndi anǝk asusun amɔr sik ne miŋ kɛ yik iya, te duŋ ta bɛ na nǝk abaŋ ndi ayik iya isik asusun ir keŋ ndi ta ne na ta isik asusun rɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ndi yik iya yi Kristi iyir miŋ asusun amɔr iyi amɛ isik asusun mɔr nak na rɛ bǝn Arik. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ate yi ndi asusun amɔr acɔk ala, ayi atu yi isik asusun min bǝn ita zhɔk min; ate yi ndi asusun amɔr atei sik, ayi atu ayi sik asusun min, ai yi gli vuŋ susun nyɛmɛ iyi yik iya yiŋɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Izhɔk susun mɔr ne atu min nak yi mgbamgbaŋ, te ta ni zhi te di ir keŋ ndi izhin yik iya ndɔ bǝn abɛta, izhin nak na yir sik asusun ndɔ bǝn abɛta.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ba ta wɔb te izhin bǝ sɔŋ yaŋ zhi ba, amunya, iya yiŋ ndi ta ne yigǝ ne ŋa kɛ Asiya. Ta nǝ yik iya ndi nǝ luk naŋ ta, ndi tei shur ta adɔmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Nǝ miŋ asusun amɔr tane yik iku. Ama iyiŋɛ ne tsar ta te di kǝr ta bǝ sak ayi ne atu amɔr ba, ama ben Arik waŋ ndi alǝk abɛ ku alumɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ayi Arik wa ndi nɛ gli ta arumɔ ne aŋɔk ayi ku, iwa atei gli ta arumɔ. Ta ne shur asusun amɔr ne atu amaa te wa atei ta ta ashur, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />ndi izhin lɔk ta ben Arik, aner tetɛk atei nyɛr Arik ne atu amɔr nǝ ki didik ndi nɛ nǝk ta ne atu ayi ben yiŋ ndi aner tetɛk ne ben ne atu amɔr.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne sen tsǝn maa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Waŋa ayi ŋur asa mɔr: Idur mɔr bla ta te di ta ne tsǝn anenen ne gɔŋmimi, te bǝn sɔŋ mɔr bǝn zhin, ne sɔŋ tsetser bǝn bla zub iyiŋ ndi ire bǝn Arik. Ba ta ne nai rɛ Mgbemgbeb kɛ gɔŋmimi ba ama ne rɛ iki didik iyi Arik. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ba ta ne cɛr zhin iki yiŋ ndi ba zhin tei zhi tɔi kɔ vuŋǝ ba. M zhɔk susun tǝ ndi, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />ir keŋ ndi izhin ne zhi ta watsɔb, izhin tei nyɛ zhi te di izhin tei ŋur asa ne atu amɔr ir keŋ ndi taba ma tei na ŋur asa ne atu amin ne bɛr yi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ndi mne mvuŋ nkan yiŋɛ ngli mgbamgbaŋ, mne ndi M tei nkuti ngar ben zhin baliŋ te duŋ zhin bǝ li iki didik mɔr amkpaŋ aya. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Mne men di M tei nyɛ ben abɛ zhin ndi mte ngar Makidɔniya, tem kana nkam rɛ Makidɔniya te nyɛ ben zhin, te izhin bǝka zǝk me te zhɔk ne Yahudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ndi mnǝ mbla ilɛmɛ, mnǝ mbla kɛ lɔrɔ i? Ka mnǝ mbla ir lɛ kɛ neshir iwaŋ ndi ate di, &lt;&lt;Ɛ ibǝ yi ɛ&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɔ,ɔ ibǝ yi ɔ,ɔ&gt;&gt;?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ama ir keŋ ndi Arik abla zub ir lɛ kɛ neshir lɛ kɛ neshir, ishar mɔr bǝn zhin ba yi &lt;&lt;Ɛ bǝn ɔ,ɔ ba&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Tǝ Izu Arik, Yesɔ Kristi waŋ ndi nga bǝn Sila bǝn Timoti tanǝ bla zhin lɛ maa, ba yi &lt;&lt;Ɛ&gt;&gt; bǝn &lt;&lt;Ɔ ɔ&gt;&gt; ba. Ama ne miŋ maa inak yi &lt;&lt;Ɛ&gt;&gt;; <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />kɔ ate yi ndi ikpa nyak ndi Arik ne nai, inak yi &lt;&lt;Ɛ&gt;&gt; ne miŋ Kristi. Nǝ miŋ maa ta bla &lt;&lt;Iyemɛ&gt;&gt; ne gbar iye Arik. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ayi Arik wa ne duŋ ta ben zhin tsǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, iwa ne hria ta, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />tǝ alas ngir asak taba aner amaa, te ana shur Izhu Tsetser maa ne miŋ asusun amɔr te bɛ tsar ta kiki yiŋ ndi ne ashurǝ anyak ta nǝ ti.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Arik wa ayi nǝ yaa amuŋ iwa ne zhi susun muŋ, Mne nkyak kam gar kɔrɔntiya te bɛ kam zhin anyak. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Ba ta nǝk zhin hru ne tanyɛmɛ min ba, ama ta na ndum ndɔ bǝn abɛ zhin te ayi nyɛr min, te ayi tanyɛmɛ min iyi duŋ zhin kli mgbamgbaŋ.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Fe mne ndi ne susun muŋ te ndi bam ntei na nyɛ bǝn zhin ndi rǝra te zhin ba, <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ate yi ndi mne nek zhin rǝra, ayi ŋɔwa atei na duŋ me nyɛr mba izhineba ndi mne nek zhin rǝra ma kai? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Mne ncɛr zhin ir keŋ ndi mne ncɛre, te duŋ ndi mtǝ nyɛ kǝr mbǝ yi nǝ mɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi aba yi abɛ duŋ susun muŋ men. Mnǝ ntanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk, te ndi izhin tei nak nyɛr bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Tǝ mne ncɛr zhin nǝ miŋ kɛ lɛn susun ben rǝra ben zhin amayi tetɛk ba, te zhin bǝ zhi te di nyɛr zhin ngɔŋ naŋ nǝk zhin rǝra.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuk ne la lɛ zhɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ate yi ndi nuŋ ne nek rǝra, bane anem rǝra ba ama ne nek zhin rǝra bɔbɔk mine, bam bla amɛ tem mnǝk zhin rǝra ngɔŋ ba. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Iyah yiŋ ndi aneshir tetɛk neka nǝgu neyi ne mlau ma. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Azǝzaŋa fe izhin bǝ zu gu zhɔk te na kɔru, kǝr kɔr susun bǝ shagu kpa ngɔŋ ba. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mben zhin, te izhin bǝ tau ne nyɛr ngɔŋ. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Mne men cɛr zhin te mtɔ itsikli min ben zǝ lɛ anenen min ne kɔte nii. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Izhin te zuk nuŋ zhɔk, nga muŋ yi Mnǝ nzugu nzhɔk. Iki yiŋ ndi mne zugǝ nzhɔk, ate yi ndi iki yi zuk zhɔk yime, mne nka nzugǝ nzhɔk ne ti kɛ Kristi ne atu amin, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />te duŋ kǝr shetan bɛ vu ta awa ba. Tǝ ta ne men zhi nkuŋkɔŋ maa.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne lɛ ni susun ne atu Taruwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Fe ndi mne yir Tarwasa tǝ ngar du lɛ kǝ men nɛ atu yi Kristi, Mnǝ yik Ŋgɔŋ nɛ buum alǝla anǝ na ndum amɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Susun muŋ ne kyak zǝ kur ba, ndi bam ne yik zumɔr Titus amɔ ba. Fe mne nduŋ anere tǝ nkam kɔmɔ nǝ Makidɔniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Fena ta ne nyɛr Arik, waŋ ndi agli ta atsine ne itsin kɛ gah mɔr ben Kristi, waŋ ndi ne atu amɔr, iwa ne abwa mgbɔ shushum ndi Izhu ashak kɔte me. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Tǝ taba yi mgbɔ shushum iyi Kristi ne ti kɛ Arik ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi azǝn ta izuk zhɔk bǝn abɛ yir miŋ lu. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ta ye mgbɔ vimvir iyi ku bǝn anuŋ; te na ŋu mgbɔ shushum iyi tsitsir bǝn anuŋ. Fe ayi ŋɔwa atei baŋ ihru kǝŋe? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ba ta yi ndi idu aneshir abaŋ ndi abla lɛ kɛ Arik te bɛ aya ba ba. Nǝ ŋa nuŋ, ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, ta du lɛ kɛ Arik anenen, ir kɛ aner abɛ rɛ ben Arik.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ta tak kam gbar atu amɔr fei? Ka ta wɔb amplɛ cɛr ayi rɛ ben zhin kɔ ayi nek zhin ini? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Izhineba ne tu min yi ndi mplɛ kɛ cɛr mɔr, ndi ne cɛr kɛ ne asusun amɔr, keŋ ndi kɔte ŋɔwa ne zhi tena tɔ kɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Iyi ndende ndi Kristi nǝ tu maa nɛ cɛr mplɛ kǝŋe tɛ shar kǝ nɛ aŋɔk amɔr. Nɛ cɛr kǝ, ba nɛ ama nteb ba, ama ne Izhu yi Arik tsitsir, ba ne tu mkpaŋ ba ama ne miŋ asusun amɔr.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Waŋa ayi zhɔk susun mɔr ben Arik ne aŋɔk Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ba taba yine mgbyamgbyaŋ nuŋ kɛ tu mɔr kɛ na kinuŋ ba, mgbyamgbyaŋ mɔrɔ rɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Arik wa nɛ nǝk ta izhi, te duŋ ta bǝ yi abɛ na ndum kɛ kpa nyak yayas ba kpa nyak yi cɛr mplɛ ba, iyi Izhu; te mplɛ kɛ cɛrǝ iŋun, ama Izhu mɔ inǝk vli tsitsir.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irɛ kɛ kpa nyak yayas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Icɛr yi Musa anǝ subǝ nǝ mkpaŋ, fe ngɔŋ kɛ Arik nǝ munru ndi ne nǝk kǝ. Ko ndi iti kǝ Musa nǝ tǝ duŋ aner abǝ Isrela banɛ tɔ ti kɛ Musa ayir ba nǝ zar ayi. Ate yi ndi icɛr yi Musa, iyiŋ ndi igli iku nyɛmɛ ndi itǝ yi nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ, inyɛ nǝ ngɔŋ maa, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ai tayi naŋ nǝ ngɔŋ kǝŋ ndi iyi kǝ ndum kǝ Izhu Tsetser! <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />ate yi ndi ndum kɛ nkan alɛ yi ku iyi ngɔŋ, fena ndum kɛ gli sɔŋ tsetser nyɛmɛ iyi ŋgɔŋɔ ka! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ta tei ka di tǝ nɛtu ayiŋ ndi nǝ yi ngɔŋ nǝka yik yiŋ ndi yi ngɔŋ naŋǝ. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ate yi ndi iki yi baŋ mkpaŋ watsɔb ne yi ngɔŋ, ai iyiŋ ndi ibaŋ mkpaŋ kǝ lɛ inaŋǝ!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Fena, ndi ta yi nǝ zhɔk susun yiŋɛ, ta yine klik asusun. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ba ta yi ndi Musa ba, waŋ ndi ne ku ti maa ne mplenklu te kǝr aner abɛ Isrela bǝ yik zar ayi maa ba kɔ ndi zar ayi me ne baŋ mkpaŋ watsɔb. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ama asusun amene ane du aru, ndi kam nyak azǝzaŋa mplenklu mɔ yime ndi ate bla nkan alɛ yi cɛr Musa ashur ba, ba ne azǝn atun kǝ adɛme ba, anak ayi Kristi wa ankyak ai tun kɛ adɛ me. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />kɔ aliŋe ate bla icɛr yi Musa ashur ba, mplenklu kǝŋe lab ku asusun amene. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Fena mkpaŋ ndi nuŋ ate akam aŋyak ben Arik Ŋgɔŋ, abaŋ mplenklu mɔ adɛ me <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Azizaŋa, Arik Ŋgɔŋ wa ayi Izhu, amkpa waŋ ndi Izhu iyi Ŋgɔŋ ayime, izuk aneshir zhɔk yime. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Taba bɔbɔk mɔrɔ, ndi mplenklu bane ku ati amɔr ba, ta tsar laŋ ne ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik Ŋgɔŋ, ne kam ta asen ne ŋgɔŋ maa tetɛk, ire ben Arik Ŋgɔŋ waŋ ndi ayi Izhu Tsetser.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Adudunki ne miŋ mkpalin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Fena, ba ta tei sik kpa ba ndi Arik nɛ lǝk ayi atɔ tama, te anǝk ta ndum kǝŋe. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Ndɔ mɔr ba yime ne ku kiki mimin bǝn yi nǝk shisha yir ba; ba taba ku amacincii ba, kɔ tabǝ bun lɛ kɛ Arik cɔk la ba. Taba tsi kli ne du lɛ didik ndende, kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ yik lɛ zub mɔr ndende ne dur maa ne ayi aye Arik. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />ate yi ndi ne ku ilɛ kǝ men wɔ kǝŋe, ne ku kɛ ayar abɛ dɔ ahwaŋa ankyak. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Shetan waŋ ndi wa ayi arik ayou abɛ kab kǝŋe abǝ yaŋ zhi Arik iwa ne las asusun amǝne aku, te duŋ ba bɛ yaŋ yik laŋ amkpa yi lɛ kɛ men kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ waŋ ndi wa ayi Izhu yi Arik. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ba ta bla zhin lɛ kɛ atu amɔr ba, ama atu ayi Yesɔ Kristi ndi ayi Ŋgɔŋ, ben taba agen amin ne atu ayi Yesɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Arik waŋ ndi ne di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ miŋ kǝ bu ilu tei laŋ!&gt;&gt; ina yi anenen Arik wa nɛ na laŋ maa bǝ hrie ne asusun amɔr, te glii izhi ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik keŋ ndi ilaŋ nǝ ti kɛ Kristi.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ndi amɛ ta yi ne adudunki ayiŋɛ ne miŋ mkpalin te tabǝ zhi te di mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝŋe yi kɛ Arik, bai mɔr ba. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Ayar ta shur vli, ama bane mla ta las anyaŋ ba; ne kpur ta, ama ba ta ne kyak kam ti ba; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />awɔb ta abɛ tsik ŋlɔk, ama ba ne kyak ta ba; atsik ta atyak ahrie, ama ba ne shur ta adɔmɔ ba. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ta yik iku kɔte bɛr tayi ne atu yi Yesɔ ne kpa mɔr, tǝ duŋ susun kɛ Yesɔ bǝ nak mwaŋ ru ne kpa mɔrɔ. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Fena taba ndi ta yi atsitsir ta nak yi gbahir kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ ben iku ne tu kɛ Yesɔ, te duŋ izhu yi Yesɔ mɔ bǝ kam mwaŋ ru ne kpa mɔr. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Itei yi amɛ, iku kur na ndum ne miŋ mɔr, tǝ ivli zen na ndum ne miŋ min.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ane cɛr tedi: &lt;&lt;Mne nta nyɛmɛ; te duŋ mne mbla lɛ.&gt;&gt; Taba mɔryi nǝ tanyɛmɛ te duŋ ta nak na lɛ, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Fena ta ne zhi te di waŋ ndi ne lǝk Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ alumɔ ne bɛ ai wa atei na lɛk ta alumɔ ndɔ bǝn Yesɔ te avu ta ben zhin atsar tu maa. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Iyiŋɛ bɔbɔk iye atu amin; bǝn itazhɔk iye Arik nǝ yir min aneshir ngɔŋ, atei nyɛr nyɛ shak nǝk ngɔŋ kɛ Arik iben tetɛk iyi nǝk nyer.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Fena ba ta tei yaŋ zhɔk susun ba, kɔ ndi akpa amɔr ayi abɛm azǝn cɔkla, miŋ asusun amɔr azǝn kam te ayayas kɔte bɛr tayi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ivǝ yik iya mɔrɔ izǝn tuŋ sɔŋ kɛ ngɔŋ kɛ mwak yaŋ klɛ nyak ta. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Te ba ta shur ayi amɔr ne kiki iyi yik ayi ba, ama ne kiki ndi ba yigǝ ba. Amɛ ndi kiki ndi ayige ibaŋ mkpaŋ watsɔb, ama iyiŋ ndi ba ayige ba ibaŋ ase ayi yaŋ klɛ.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ikɔb kɛ sɔŋ mɔr ne Gbarshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Neme ta ne zhi teyi ndi ate ŋun ikpa mɔr kɛ gɔŋmimi, tɛ zǝr kǝ, Arik atei yi nǝ kɔb kǝ shu ikǝ sɔŋ mɔr, ikɔb kǝŋ ndi iwa nɛ mɛ kǝ nǝ tu maa, ikǝŋ ndi tei yimɛ iyaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Neme ta kɔr asusun, te ŋub te Yesɔ abɛ suu ta ikpa kɛ gbarshu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ankyak atei su ta kpa, ba ta tei yi mgbawun ba. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ndi ta ri yi ne kpa kǝŋe, ta yi ne mɔ, ba ta wɔb te ta bǝ yi mgbawun ba ama Yesɔ abɛ suu ta iki yi shu, tǝ kpa kɛ yaŋ ku bǝ mli kǝ ku dɔmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Fe ayi Arik wa ne na ta netu ki yiŋe te bǝ nyak Izhu maa aŋub tama, tǝ duŋ ta bǝ zhi iki yiŋ ndi nyɛɛ ta nǝ ti.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ndi amɛ ta yine zhɔk susun tena zhi te ta yine kɔb ne miŋ kɛ kpa ta yi shaan bǝn Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ta tsǝn ne tanyɛmɛ, banǝ yik ayi ba. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ta yine zhɔk susun, te di, ne rɛ te tabǝ duŋ kpa kɛ be kǝŋe te sɔŋ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ ne kɔb. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Waŋa ai ki sak ayi mɔr ben Arik te tabǝ sigu susun, kɔ tabǝ yi ne kpa kǝŋe ka tayi gbagbaŋ ma ne kǝ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />kɔ tabǝ yaŋ ta nyɛmɛ ta tei ru kli ne ti kɛ Kristi ne amkpa ane te ambuk amaa, te kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ ta kiyiŋ ndi ne teu anenen ki yiŋ ndi ne nai ne kpa kǝŋe, kɔte yi didik kɔ mimin.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndum kɛ wɔb sɔŋ keke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ndi amɛ, fe, tane zhi klu sǝsǝk Arik, tane te tabǝ vuŋ atu aneshire. Iki ndi ta yime iyi ndende ne ti kɛ Arik, fe Ŋgam myik inayi ndende ne dur min. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ba ta wɔb te tabǝ gbar atu amɔr asak ben abɛ zhin ba, neme ta nek zhin alɛla awaŋa te zhin bǝ gah ben abɛta, te duŋ zhin sak abaŋ ndi alǝk atu amen ne ki ndi ayige neyi inaŋ yiŋ ndi ikur ne miŋ susun. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ate yi ndi atu amɔr ba yi anenen ba, ai ayi atu ayi Arik; ate yi ndi atu amɔr ayi anenen, ayi ne atu amin. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ndi tanyɛme iyi Kristi ne shak ta asusun, te ta ne tanyɛme te di Izhiin ne ku netu aneshir bɔbɔk, fena aneshir ne ku bɔbɔk. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ndi amɛ Yesɔ ne ku ne atu amɔr bɔbɔk, te abaŋ ndi ayi atsitsir kǝr abɛ sɔŋ iyi atu amen ba ama iwaŋ ndi ne ku ne atu amene ne lɛgu ne bɛ me.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ankyak nak baŋ rɛ azizaŋa te kɔmɔ ne ti bata tɔ nuŋ ne tɔi kpa kɛ goŋ mimi kǝŋe ba. Fena tane ben tɔ Yesɔ iyaŋ shaga ayi, bata nak ri na me ba. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ndi amɛ, inuŋ waŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, ayi ner yayas; kiki yi kukub neka gayir, yayas neka nyɛ! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk ire ben Arik, iwaŋ ndi ne biŋ ta ne tu maa ne ŋɔk kɛ Kristi tena nek ta ndum kɛ biŋ atu aneshir: <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />te Arik ne biŋ goŋ mimi ne tu maa ne ŋɔk kɛ Kristi, bane bla lalɛ aneshir ne atu amen ba. Ne na nek ta lɛ kɛ biŋ aneshir ben Arik. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Fena ta yi ayi Kristi ndi Arik ne duŋ ta yi abɛ biŋu aneshir ta ben zhin nǝ zhi iyi kristi: Izhin bǝ nek Arik atu min. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Arik wa ne duŋ Yesɔ ndi bai nǝ lalɛ ba te bɛ yine lalɛ ne tu mɔr, te bǝ yi ne tu maa ta bǝ yi tsetser ben Arik.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ndi ta yi aner abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ta ben zhin kǝr zhin bǝ ta itazhɔk iye Arik isha ba. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Wɔ ki ndi Arik adi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ tǝ nyɛ ndi ntei tsar zhin lɔ susun muŋ, Mnǝ wɔ zhin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Iber ta zhɔk Mne lɔk zhin ne.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ndi berɛ tǝ nyem tǝm zuk zhin shur, Mnǝ nzɔk zhin.&gt;&gt; Wɔ! waŋa ayi mkpaŋ kǝ ta lɔ susun iye Arik; aliŋ ayi berɛ tǝ ubǝ yik itazhɔk!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyik iyah yi Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Bata ne yii nuŋ mkpaŋ yi tar za ba, te duŋ ndum mɔr batei yi kɛ sha ba. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Neme, ndi ta yi agɛn abɛ Arik te sak atu mɔr ne kɔte ankɔŋ atawa: ne vuŋ kpa gli ŋgɔŋ; ne yik iya, bǝn sak ta iya; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />tanǝ yik ki mimin, bǝn itsik, ikur nǝ jaru bǝn tsik mgbu; ne na ndum kɛ iya, iyaŋ kurna bǝn ikasa; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />ne sɔŋ yi tsetser, izhi, vuŋ susun bǝn ina didik; ne Izhu Tsetser ben nyɛr akpa didik; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />ne bla ilɛ didik ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik; bǝn gli itanyɛmɛ mɔr ndi iki tyak ikum iyi tsetser ne ŋɔk li ben ŋɔk mla. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Nɛ nǝkta ngɔŋ tɛna pwar ta; nɛ yen ta tɛna gbar ta. Nɛ naa ta ndi aner abǝ ti mu, ama ta ye abǝ bla zub; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />ne zhi ta ama ana ndi ba ne zhi ta ba; tayi ndi ta ni ku, ama ta yi atsitsir; ne tsik ta ama bane aŋlɔk ta ba; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />ne miŋ kɛ lɔ susun, ama ta nyɛr; abɛ yaŋ iki, ama ta duŋ anuŋ ayi ne adudunki; bata yine ikinuŋ ba, ta yine kɔte nii.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ta ne lɛ ne zhɔk susun bene be zhin, aner abɛ kɔrɔntiya, te bu zhin asusun amɔr. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Bata ne kyak ta zhin ne asusun amɔr ba, ayi zhineba ne kyak ta tama. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Mli ben abɛ zhin ndi amun muŋ, zhɔk zhin susun ben abɛta.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝr zhin bǝ biŋ atu ben abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Kǝr zhin bǝ biŋ atu bǝn abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik ba. Aye anii ne biŋ sɔŋ kɛ yi tsetser bǝn sɔŋ mimin? Aye anii nǝ na biŋ laŋ amkpa ben ibu? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Ayi isɔŋ didik takɛ ne biŋ Kristi bǝn Ishetan? Aye anii ne biŋ ne zǝ Arik bǝn nǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Aye anii ne biŋ akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik ben bur anerim? Tǝ taba yi akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik tsitsir! Ndi Arik nǝ tu maa adi, &lt;&lt;M tei na kɔmuŋ bǝn aner amuŋ tǝ nsɔŋ nǝ miŋ men; M tei yi Arik amen, aba atei na yi aneshir amuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Neme Ŋgɔŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ duŋ ba tǝ na ŋar akpamin nǝ miŋ mǝne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Kǝr zhin bǝ na kinuŋ ndi ba yi tsetser ba, fe Ngam tei nta zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />&lt;&lt;M tei yi Tetɛɛ bǝn abɛ zhin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Izhineba ba tei yi amumune amuŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Arik Ŋgɔŋ wa ne di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Bɔbɔk ikpa nyak yiŋe nɛ nai nɛ atu amɔr, izhineba akpa amuŋ, fena, duŋ ta bǝ ŋla akpamɔr nǝ kɔte nii ndi tei duŋ ta bǝ yaŋ yi tsetser, tǝna duŋ ta bǝ shaga nǝ tsetser nǝ sɔŋ kǝ nǝk Arik ŋgɔŋ maa.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyɛr yi Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Zhɔk zhin asusun bǝn abɛta. Ba ta ne la nuŋ lɛ ba, ba ta ne kyer kinuŋ iyi nuŋ ta ba, ba ta ne cɔk sak kɛ nuŋ la ba. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Bam bla iyiŋɛ tem la zhin ba; Mne nka men mbla zhin te ndi izhin yine miŋ asusun amɔr kɔ ta bǝ ku kɔ ta bǝ yi atsitsir <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛ zhin tetɛk; Mŋur asa bǝn abɛ zhin ngɔŋ. Susun muŋ nǝ nyɛr ngɔŋ; ne yik iya mɔr bɔbɔk ndi nyɛr muŋ ba yi klɛtu ba.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi tane yine Makidɔniya, ba ta ne sɔŋ sik ba, nɛ nǝkta iya tetɛk, abɛ yine abɛm nɛ kyak ta, te na nǝkta sisik nɛ asusun amɔr. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ama Arik waŋ ndi aduŋ asusun abɛ yaŋ tɔ shak ayi azekur, ayi wa ane duŋ asusun amɔr azekur ne nyɛ yi Titus, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />ba ne nyɛ maa iyi ankyak ba ama ir keŋ ndi izhin ne duŋ susun maa zekur. Ne bla ta ir keŋ ndi izhin ŋub nyɛ muŋ, lɛn asusun min ngɔŋ, itanyɛme min ben abɛm, ne duŋ mne nyɛr tetɛk.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ate yi ndi icɛr muŋɔ ne cɔk asusun laa zhin, bam ne ndi ayi anii ne duŋ mne na amɛ ba. Mne na amɛ ne kuti, Myik ndi icɛr muŋɔ ne laa zhin asusun, ama ne ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Neme mne nyɛr azezaŋa, ndi ba zhin ne wɔ lɛn asusun ba, ama lɔ asusun min ne duŋ zhin duŋ la lɛ. Lɔ asusun mine ne yi ne ankɔŋ ndi Arik nɛ tanyɛmɛ te duŋ ba zhin ne yaŋ ikinuŋ ne tu amɔr ba. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Lɔ asusun ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik iduŋ neshir aduŋ zumimin maa te yik ita zhɔk te yaŋ duŋ di mbǝ zhi amǝ, ama lɔ asusun abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik igli iku nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Tɔ zhin ki yiŋ ndi lɔ asusun ne ankɔŋ adidik ndi Arik nɛ glii anyɛ zhinɛ: Inǝk asusun amin nǝ na zhin, ishur ayi min nǝ gli atu amin gli rumɔ! Itǝ mfu iyiŋe, isisik iyiŋe, inǝk tu min, izhɔk asusun min tǝ abɛ sak abǝ la lɛ iya! Izhin nǝ tsar atu amin tǝ yi abǝ yaŋ lalɛ nǝ kɔte ankɔŋ atawa. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Neme, ndi Mnǝ men cɛr zhin, bane yi ne tu ayi ner ne lalɛ yuŋɔ ba kɔ abaŋ ndi ne la ba lɛ, M ncɛr kǝ tǝm duŋ kǝ yi ndende bǝnɛ bezhin, nǝ ti ke Arik, neme izhin ne yik ir keŋ ndi izhin nǝ nǝk atu amin bǝn abɛta. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Fe izhin ne duŋ asusun amɔr ne klik.<verse eid="2CO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="cp">Iki yiŋ ndi ne na duŋ akpa amɔr aŋur klik, ta ne yik Titus azǝn nyɛr ndi bɔbɔk mine izhin ne duŋ ikpa maa ŋur klik. <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Mne men ŋur asa bǝn abɔu nɛ atu amin, ndi ba zhin nǝ zhɔk mǝ shisha ba. Ir kǝŋ ndi ta ne men bla zhin kɔte anii iyi zub neme ŋur asa mɔr ne atu amin ben Titus ne duŋ ta zhi te ayi lɛ didik. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Neme itanyɛmɛ maa nɛ atu amin itǝ ngɔŋ, ndi ashu azhi ir kǝŋ ndi bɔbɔk min nǝ nǝk atu nǝ lɛ maa, ndi izhin nǝ sisik bǝn irǝ kpa. 16 Mne nyɛr M tei zhɔk susun bene abɛ zhin.<verse eid="2CO 7:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Inǝk ne bu susun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Akpa amɔr, ta wɔb tǝ izhin bǝ zhi iki didik yiŋ ndi Arik nɛ naa abǝ zǝu nǝ ntuntun yi Makidɔniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah ngɔŋ ndi ne nek ba neyi, ne nyɛr ne miŋ kɛ yaŋ iki, ne bu asusun te na iki didik. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Mnǝ yik nɛ ayi amuŋ tǝ nɛ nek nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ men, ne nǝk agara kam mgbyamgbyaŋ men, Nǝ yiŋe anɛ yi nǝ miŋ kǝ yaŋ kiki men, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />nɛ ben ta ngɔŋ tǝ ta bǝ tanyɛmɛ tɛ aba men yi abe yi nǝ min kǝ zɔk abǝ na ndum Arik nǝ Yahuda. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Nɛ anaŋ ir keŋ ndi ta nǝ zhɔk susun nɔ! Nɛ kuti anǝk Ŋgɔŋ asusun amen; fe, ankyak, nǝ taa nyɛmɛ Arik nɛ nǝk ta atu amenɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ankyak tane ben Titus, te ai wa ne kuti adu ba lɛ kɛ Arik, iwa abɛ klɛ ndum didik kǝŋe ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Neme ndi izhin nǝ men na kɔte nii ne kuti, nɛ tanyɛmɛ, nǝ lɛ, nɛ zhi, nɛ nǝk atu amin ngɔŋ, bǝn itanyɛmɛ min bǝn abɛta, izhin bǝ nak na nǝk atu min ngɔŋ nǝ na ndum kǝ nyɛr.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Bam tsar zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, ama mwɔb tǝ izhin bǝ tsar nǝk atu min tǝ na yik nyɛr bǝn iyi anuŋ. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Tǝ izhin ne zhi ita zhɔk iyi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi Almasihu amɔr, ndi ne yi kɔte ni ne shu, ama ne kama yaŋ iki ne tu min, te duŋ yaŋ ki maa bǝ duŋ izhin bǝ ne ne kɔte ni ben Arik.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Waŋa ai ilɛ kɛ nek muŋ keŋ ne atu yi ki yiŋ ndi ire zhin: Isise izhineba ne yi abɛ kuti ba ne nek ankyak ba ama izhin ne yine bubu iyi na amɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Amɛ izhin bǝ klɛ ndumo, ndi izhin ne kuti na kɛ ne asusun amin, te duŋ bubu min bǝ tsik biŋ ne klɛtu mɔ, ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ki ndi izhin yime neyi. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Tǝ ate yi ndi bubumɔ te yime, Arik atei ta iki yiŋ ndi ne nǝge, ndi atei nege susun zhin.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Bai wɔb mɔr te izhin bǝ yik iyah te anuŋ abɛ sɔŋ asik ba, ama izhin bǝ yi anenen. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kǝŋe yine adudunki min izhin lɔk abɛ yaŋǝ, teduŋ mkpaŋ nuŋ aba menyi atei lɔk zhin ne adudunki amen. Fe neme izhin tei yi anenen, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />ndi ne cɛr: &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ne biŋ tetɛk bane yime neyi tetɛk ba, iwaŋ ndi ne biŋ watsɔb bane yime neyi watsɔb ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ne shar Titus ne kɔrɔntiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mne nyɛr Arik, ndi nɛ nǝk Titus nǝ susun anenen bǝn muŋ netu amin. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ba Titus nɛ wɔ ben mɔr ankyak ba, ama atei nyɛ bǝn abɛ zhin nǝ nǝk tu bǝn tanyɛmɛ maa. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ta tei sharu ndɔ ben zumɔr waŋ ndi aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ zǝ Arik agbaru asak ne na ndum kɛ du ilɛ didik kǝ men. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Ba amɛ ankyak ba, abɛ akabaŋkɔŋ nɛ hriau tɛna duŋu abɛ zǝ ta nǝ ndum kǝŋe kǝ nyɛr ndi ta gli ikiki yiŋ ndi nɛ nǝgǝ, ndi ta nǝk Ŋgɔŋ ngɔŋ nǝ tsar nǝk atu amɔr ne lɔk aneshir. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ta na tǝ bǝr tǝ zǝǝ tǝ kǝr nuŋ abɛ nab ta vǝnŋɔk ne atu yi kiki yiŋ ndi nɛ nǝgɛ susun zhiin ba. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ta ne nek atu te ta bǝ na iki didik, ba ne ayi Ŋgɔŋ ankyak ba, ama ne ti kɛ aneshir.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ba me ankyak ba, ta na shar zumɔr nuŋ ndɔ bene aba iwaŋ ndi amkpaŋ tetɛk ne tsar ta te wa ayi ne nek tu, ne naŋ amɛ itanyɛme ben abɛ zhin maa iyi ngɔŋ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Ate yi Titus, ayim ikpa muŋ inǝ na ndum tɛ na yinǝ miŋ min; ate yi amunzumɔr, ayi abɛ anɛr abǝ zǝ Arik tǝna nǝk Kristi ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Neme izhin bǝ tsar anɛr abaŋa inyɛr min bǝn aba bǝn iki yi ŋur asa mɔr bǝn abɛ zhin, tǝ anɛr abǝ zǝ Arik abɛ yik.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ba nǝ tǝ tǝm na cɛr zhin nɛ atu yi biŋ kiki yi nǝk anɛr abɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Mnǝ zhi tǝ izhin nɛ asusun ayi nǝk ikia iki didik, me ŋur asa bǝn aneshir abɛ Makidɔniya. &lt;&lt;Aner abǝ zǝ Arik nǝ Akaya. M ndi, &lt;&lt;nǝ mɛn nyagǝ tǝm lɔk zhin irɛ sǝse.&gt;&gt; Inǝk tu min nǝ lǝk anuŋ nyak. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Azǝzaŋa M shar abǝ zǝ Arik, tǝ iŋur asa mɔr nɛ atu min nǝ ilɛ kǝŋe kǝr bǝ yi lǝlɛ yi sha ba. Ama, ndi M nǝ bla, izhin tei sɔŋ ŋub mkpaŋ kǝ nǝk kiki min. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Tǝyi ndi aner abɛ Makidɔniya te zǝm anyɛ te yik zhin kusɔŋ awa, bata tei yine iki di ba, shisha tei vuŋ ta. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Neme mne yik nǝ rɛ tǝ abǝ zǝ Arik anuŋ bǝ kumti anyɛ ben abɛ zhin te zhin bǝ biŋ ikiki nyak yi nǝk yiŋ ndi zhin ne men kpa nyak. Fe ite yi nek yi susun zhin, bai nek yi lɛ mumur ba.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inǝk ne susun zhin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Izhin bǝ shuzhi: Waŋ ndi ate tib watsɔb atei sɛr watsɔb, waŋ ndi te tib ne susun zhin atei sɛr tetɛk. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ nǝk ir keŋ ndi susun maa nǝ diu abɛ nǝk, ba nǝ mɔ kɔ ndi nɛ sagu nǝk nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, te Arik a nyɛr abɛ nǝk nǝ nyɛr yi susun zhiin. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Fe Arik nɛ mla nǝ nǝk zhin iki didik tetɛk, te izhin bǝ yine ikiki bɔbɔk ne kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ, izhin bǝ na yine iki yiŋ ndi izhin wɔ bǝ, te izhin tei na ikiki didik. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik nǝ di, &lt;&lt;Arik anǝk abǝ iya iki tetɛk; ina didik maa ba yine klɛ tu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Amɛ Arik waŋ ndi anǝk bǝbǝ yi tib tɛ na nǝk ikili ai wa atei nǝk zhin bǝbǝ yi tib tetɛk ai wa atei na sak ŋɔk didik nǝ ndum kɛ ŋɔk amin. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Arik atei nek zhin adudunki tetɛk te izhin bǝ nek ne susun zhin kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ, ne atu amɔr ibu aŋɔk min itei duŋ abɛ nyɛr Arik.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ndum keŋ ndi izhin zǝn nakǝ ba yi kɛ nǝk anɛr abǝ zǝ Arik ikili ankyak ba ama iyi kɛ nyɛr Arik tetɛk. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Neme ndum keŋ ndi izhin nǝ na kɛ ne tsar itanyɛmɛ min ben Arik, aneshir atei gbar Arik asak ne nek asusun min ben tanyɛmɛ ne ilɛ didik yayas kɛ Kristi, bǝn ir keŋ ndi izhin ne lɔk bama ben kɔte ŋɔwa. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Aba menyi atei ben zhin Arik te na zhɔk asusun amen te bǝ yik zhin, nǝ iki didik yiŋ ndi Arik ne na zhin ne yi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tabǝ nyɛr Arik ne iki yiŋ ndi ne nai ndi bata tei zhi blai ba.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne bla tsi kli ne ndum maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nǝ zi tu zhɔk ben shur kpa yi Kristi, Mben zhin, Nga Bulus, iwaŋ ndi me &lt;&lt;nklu sǝsǝk&gt;&gt; ne yi ben ayi bǝn abɛ zhin, ama &lt;&lt;nǝ tar kli mgbamgbaŋ&gt;&gt; ndi bam teyi ben abɛ zhin ba! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Mben zhin tǝ kǝr zhiŋ bǝ shɔk mǝ tǝm tǝ mfu nǝ nye muŋ ba; tǝm nǝ zhi Mtei mvǝ anɛr abaŋ ndi ayik tɛ di ta tsǝn tǝ shur ayi nǝ iki yi gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ai lɛ didik tǝ ta yi nǝ gɔŋmimi, ba ta tǝ ikum ir keŋ ndi aner abɛ gɔŋmimi atǝ ba. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ikiki yi tyak kum mɔr ba yi ndi yi gɔŋmimi ba ama ai mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik, iyiŋ ndi ta bǝr glii tǝ zir iklik. Tǝ zir antam ayi gaaŋa; <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />ta cɔk te antam la ben lǝlɛ mimin yiŋ ndi yar zhin wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik, ta kum asusun aneshir vuŋ te bǝ kam azǝ Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Ta tei sɔŋ anenen te ta bǝ vǝ abɛ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Kristi, atei ndi izhin zǝ lɛ kɛ Kristi anenen.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Izhin nak tɔ ikiki iyɛ abɛm ankyak. Tǝ anuŋ amɔ abaŋ ndi adi akpa men tǝ aba yɛ abǝ Kristi? neme, duŋ ba abɛ na lɛ nɛ susun amen, tǝta yi abǝ Kristi ndi aba men yi. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ate yi ndi mbu asa mbu asa ne mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ nɛ nǝk ta tǝ ta bǝ duŋ zhin flu ne naŋ ndi ta bǝ duŋ zhin zhaku, ba shisha tei tem ba. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Bam wɔb te me duŋ sǝsǝk te zhin ne cɛr muŋ ba. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Tǝ duŋ anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Icɛr Bulus iluk tǝ na klik, ama ate yi bǝn abɛta ikpa maa sik, fe lǝlɛ maa bai kinuŋ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Ir aneshir abaŋa bǝ zhi te di ta yi amɛ ne cɛr mɔr ndi bata yime ba, ta te na iki yiŋ ndi tane cɛrǝ ndi ta yime.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Bata tei biŋ kɔ tsar atu mɔr ben abaŋ ndi agbar atu men ba. Ndi abiŋ atu men ben atu men tena tsar atu men bǝn atu men, ba ayi ne Mgbemgbeb ba. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Neme, taba, bata tei ŋur asa naŋ ndi ne nyak ta ba, ama ta duŋ ŋur asa mɔr ikli ne amkpa waŋ ndi Arik nɛ nyak ta, amkpa waŋ ndi ne vuŋ zhin. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ba ta ne te gbagbaŋ ne ŋur asa mɔr ba, abɛ yi lɛ mimin ndi ba tei bǝ nyɛ ben abɛ zhin ba, ayi taba ne kuti gli zhin ilɛ didik yayas kɛ Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Iŋur asa mɔr ba ne gar kam ndum keŋ ndi ta ne na kɛ ba. Izhɔk susun mɔr iyi, teyi ndi itanyɛmɛ min te flu, amkpa ane na ndum ne miŋ min itei bu, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />te ta bǝ du lɛ didik kǝ men nǝ ntuntun yi gbagbaŋ. Ba ta wɔb te ta bǝ ŋur asa ne ndum keŋ ndi ne nakǝ nǝ gar kɛ nuŋ ba. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ama ir keŋ ndi, &lt;&lt;duŋ iwaŋ ndi te ŋur asa bǝ ŋur asa bǝn Ŋgɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Tǝ ayi mkpaŋ kǝŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ alɛ susun nɛ atu amɔr tɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛta, bai mkpaŋ kǝŋ ndi ta lɛ asusun ngɔŋ nɛ atu amɔr ba.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ben abɛ tsar yi timu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Mshur ayi te zhin bǝ nak tɔ bliblik muŋ watsɔb; ama izhin neka kuti izhi kɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Mtǝ zɔr nɛ atu min ir izɔr yiŋ ndi Arik ayimɛ; izhin yi ndi tsetser isun vǝnwa iwaŋ ndi Mnǝ mkpa nyak nǝ ta lulum zhiin ankyak, Kristi nǝ tu maa. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ama mtǝ sisik tǝ kǝr bǝ yi ir keŋ ndi iwa nǝ lɔm awawu nǝ lɛ mimin maa, kǝr yiŋe bǝ duŋ asusun amin abɛ tǝ mgbemgbeb nǝ zǝ lɛ didik bǝn nek atu min bǝn Kristi ne ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa iwa nǝ lɔm Awawu nǝ mgbemgbeb kǝ mu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Te yi ndi inuŋ te nyɛ bǝn abezhin te du lɛ kǝ Yesɔ ndi bai Yesɔ waŋ ndi tane du lɛ kǝ men maa ba, itǝ nayi ndi izhin nǝ ta izhu nuŋ kaaŋkaŋ ndi izhin ne ka tei, kɔ lɛ didik nuŋ kaaŋkaŋ ndi izhin ne ta kǝ, fe izhin takɛ andanda ne ankɔŋ amimin. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ama Nga bam yik tǝ ndi myi mbushɛr bǝn abǝ zhɔ&lt;&lt;abǝ naa Yesɔ ndum&gt;&gt; amin! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Nga bam yi waŋ ndi atsaru lɛ ba, ama Mnǝ zhi. Tane duŋ zhin izhi kiki yiŋɛ anenen nǝ kɔte ankɔŋ atawa.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ne yi ilalɛ ndi mne zi tu muŋ zhɔk tǝm lɛk zhin nyak nǝ du ilɛ didik yayas kɛ Arik bǝn abezhin sha i? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Mnǝ ta kiki bǝn abǝ zǝ Yesɔ anuŋ tǝm naa izhin ndum. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ndi mne yi bǝn abezhin bam nǝ wɔb iki nuŋ ba, bam nǝ yi ihru bǝn nuŋ ba, amunya abǝ rɛ Makidɔniya nɛ gliim ikiki yi wɔb muŋ. Mnǝ yar itu muŋ nǝ yi ihru ne atu min ne kɔte nii, M tei nak na mɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ndi lɛ didik kǝ Kristi iyi nǝ miŋ muŋ, ba nuŋ nǝ gar kǝ Akaya atei yar me ŋur asa ba. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ayi anii? Bam nǝ nyer zhin kai? Arik ne zhi tǝm nyer zhin! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Amɛ M tei nak na iki yiŋ ndi mnai te mbǝ ku ankɔŋ yar abaŋ ndi awɔb te abɛba bǝ yi anenen ben abɛta ne ikiki yiŋ ndi aba ŋur asa nai.<verse eid="2CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Tǝ ir aneshir abaŋa ayi abǝ tsar mu, ndum mǝne ai lɔm aneshir, ne baŋ atu amen ndi abǝ na ndum kɛ Kristi. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Nemɛ, bai yaŋ zhi ba! Shetan nɛ zhi baŋ tu maa ndi nǝ shar ayou Arik inǝ laŋ! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Ame bai kinuŋ ngɔŋ ba ndi agɛn amaa abaŋ atu men tǝ bɛ yi ndi agɛn abǝ yi tsetser. Nǝ klɛtu atei ta kiki yi naa men anenen nǝ wɔb men.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus ne ŋur asa ne yik iyah maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Mna bla: Kǝr nuŋ abɛ yik tedi myi bliblik ba. Ama izhin te baŋ amɛ, izhin bǝ tam ndi myi bliblik, te mbǝ yiŋ ŋur asa watsɔb. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Nǝ ŋur asa muŋ bam lɛ ndi ai lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ba, ama ndi bliblik. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Tǝ yi ndi anuŋ aŋur asa ir keŋ ndi abɛ gɔŋmimi ana ma, nga muŋ yi M tei ŋur asa. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Izhin vuŋ asusun ne abɛ yi bliblik te di izhin yi abɛ Mgbemgbeb! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Le didik, izhin vuŋ asusun ben waŋ ndi akam zhin ate agɛnɛ ben fir kɔmɔ ne ti ben na zhɔk zhin la ŋɔk ne ti. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ne shisha muŋ mne tanyɛme te ndi ba ta ne mla ba!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Tǝ anii duŋ nuŋ aŋur asa. M lɛ ndi ne yi bliblik. Mna ŋur asa ne yiŋɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Abaŋa ayi nŋli kɛ Ibraniyawa i? Nga muŋ yi myi amɛ. Ayi ŋli kɛ Isrelawa i? Nga muŋ yi myi amɛ. Ayi nŋli kɛ Ibrai? Nga muŋ yi myi nŋli maa. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ayi agɛn abɛ Kristi yi? (Mli ndi waŋ ndi dur maa iyaŋa i). Mnaŋ ba. Mne na ndum naŋ ba, mne nkur ne jaru amkpaŋ tetɛk, ane tsik me amkpaŋ tetɛk, mne yik iku amkpaŋ tetɛk. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Yahudawa ne tsik me amkpaŋ atuŋ sɔknas yaŋ zhiin. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ne tsik me amkpaŋ atar ne tsǝtsa, mkpaŋ zhin ne tyak me ne nkpaŋ, Igu ne ŋar ben abɛm ne miŋe amkpaŋ atar, mne yi ne atu amashir ne bu bǝn aririk. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Nǝ min kǝ tsǝn muŋ tetɛk Mnǝ yik iya nǝ shak anca anǝ nǝk bǝn abǝ zhib, iya nɛ aŋɔk aneshir amuŋ bǝn abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba; iya nǝ yim ma nǝ miŋ ntuntun, iya nǝ zǝzǝk ngɔŋ, iya nɛ atu amshir nǝk ngɔŋ, tǝna yik iya bǝn akpa abǝ ti mu. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Mnǝ na ndum tǝ yik iya te yaŋ kurna; Izhɔŋ bǝn ihrie nǝ vuŋ mǝ Mnǝ na ntsǝn yaŋ li kili; Mne tsin ngbawuŋ ne miŋ mvlu. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ndɔ ben ikiki nuŋ tetɛk, myi ne mɔ kɔte bɛr tayi susun muŋ iyi bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Inuŋ ate yi nǝ sik kpa, fe M wɔ sik kpa muŋ yi; Ate duŋ nuŋ azhaku nǝ lalɛ, Nga mwɔ lɔmɔ nɔ susun muŋ.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Atei ndi M tei ŋur asa, M tei ŋur asa ne ikiki yiŋ ndi tsar klu aŋin muŋ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Arik bǝn Tetɛɛ amɔr Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ, waŋ ndi anu adidik ayi gbaru asak yaŋ klɛtu, ne zhi te bam timu ba. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Nǝ ntun yi Damaskɔ Gomna ndi ayi ne angus akɛ Itum Aritas ne duŋ aku nkunkɔŋ yi Damaskɔ te wa abɛ vuŋ me. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ama nɛ baŋ mǝ azhɔk nǝ sisa tɛ baŋ mǝ aru nǝ mblu kǝ adampɛm tɛ duŋ mǝ ncok ndɔ nǝ ti maa.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Irimla kɛ Bulus bǝn Iya yi itei yik maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Bam M tei nduŋ ŋur asa ba. Mne zhi te ba ikinuŋ iyi rɛ yime ba, M tei zǝ arimla bǝn kiki yi tsar ndi ire bǝn Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Mne zhi ner nuŋ ne zǝ Kristi iwaŋ ndi ne te ase awur anenas Yesɔ ane baŋu te kɔmɔ gbagbaŋ nǝ gbarshu, ne amkpa waŋ ndi Arik ayime. Ka ne baŋu ne kpa mɔr kɛ yi ne gɔŋmimi kǝŋe ka ane yi kpa keŋ ndi ba ta ne zhi kɛ ba, Arik wa ne zhi. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Fena mne zhi te ner waŋa, kɔ ne baŋu ne kpa kǝŋe ka ite naŋ kpa keŋ ndi mne zhi kɛ, ama Arik ne zhi, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Yesɔ ne baŋu ate nyak ne amkpa ane sɔŋ sik ndi azhɔu te Paradas ne amkpa anǝ sɔŋ sik abaŋ ndi nɛ ku nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ zǝ Arik bǝn kiki yiŋ ndi bam mblai yir ba, kiki yiŋ ndi Arik bane nǝk neshir mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ blai ba. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />M tei ŋur asa ne atu ayi ner yuŋɔ, ama bam ŋur asa ne atu amuŋ ba, se mŋur asa ne klu aŋin muŋ. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />kɔ atei ndi M tei ŋur asa, bam yi bliblik ba, tem mbla izub. Fe nga bam tei ŋur asa ne kiki yiŋɛ ba, te kǝr inuŋ abɛ yik me te agbar me asak ne ki ndi mblai kam mdii ma.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ndi kǝr me yine ŋur asa ne atu kiki yi vuŋ anu ngɔngɔŋ yiŋɛ ndi Arik ne nai ba, ane zhɔk me ncoŋ ne kpa muŋ, neshar ayou shetan, te abɛ sak me iyah. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Amkpaŋa tar mne ben te Arik abɛ gli ki yiŋɛ ate shaan bene bɛm. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Amɛ Yesɔ adim, &lt;&lt;Ita zhɔk muŋ ne mlau ma.&gt;&gt; Ndi amɛ iŋur asa muŋ itei yi ŋgɔŋ netu ayi klu aŋin muŋ, te mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Kristi bǝ sɔŋ netu amuŋ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Waŋa ai kime, netu ayi Kristi, Mta nyɛmɛ ne zhi ikluoŋin muŋ, ne iyen, ne yik iyah, ndi asak me iyah, ne yaŋ kiki yi sɔŋ iyi gɔŋmimi. Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi myik klu aŋin muŋ, fe myik iklik muŋ.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛn susun yi Bulus netu abɛ zǝ Arik ne kɔrɔntiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Mne kam tu muŋ ntǝ bliblik, tǝ ayi izhineba nǝ duŋ mǝ na mɛ. Abɛ yik izhin ne gbar me, te bam yine miŋ kɛ abɛ klɛtu ben &lt;&lt;abɛ lǝk tu nǝ shu tɛ aba yi abǝ na ndum kɛ Arik,&gt;&gt; kɔ nɛ mɛɛ bam yi kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ikiki yiŋ ndi iduŋ nǝ na ndum kɛ Arik, ina kiki iyi klik bǝn iyi vuŋ anu, ne nai nǝ miŋ min nǝ vuŋ susun ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Tǝ aye nii tsǝn ndi izhin di ba zhin nǝk atu ba ndi abǝ zǝ Arik ba zhin nǝk atu ba anuŋ kai, ka izhin kam te lɔgɔnu nǝ yaŋ nǝk zhin ihru muŋɔ? Zuk izhu muŋ zhɔk zhin ne ŋa anu muŋ!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Azizaŋa Mnǝ nka mkpa iki muŋ iyi nyɛ bǝn abɛ zhin mkpaŋ kǝ ntar, bam tei yii zhin ihru ba, tǝ iki yi wɔb muŋ bai kiki ndi izhin yime neyi ba ama ayi izhineba. Izhin bǝ zhi te ayi atetɛ aba baŋ hru kɛ amumun amen. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Neme M tei nyɛr tǝm ŋlɔk kiki yiŋ ndi m yime neyi bɔbɔk tena nǝk tu muŋ. M tei ntanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛ zhin tetɛk, izhin tei tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm watsɔb iyi? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ir keŋ ndi te yime, izhin ne zhi te bam ne yi zhin hru ba. Ne me, mzhi zǝb aza aneshir, mvuŋ zhin ne mfab! <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ka aner abaŋ ndi mne shar ba mgar ben zhin ne cɔk zhin nii? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mne shar Titus ben abɛ zhin tena shar izumɔr iwaŋ ndi izhin ne zhiu te bǝ gar ndɔ. Titus bane gar te wa abɛ acok zhin ba, kɔ nɛ cok zhinii? Ba ta nǝ nak na amɛ bǝn abɛ zhin te zǝ ankɔŋ azhin kai?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ama izhin nǝ zhi tǝ ta zǝn gɔŋri iyaŋ sɔŋ sik ne atu amin? Ta zǝn lɛ nǝ tii kɛ Arik nǝ miŋ kɛ Kristi; nǝ kɔte nii ndi ta na, izhin akpa amuŋ, inama yi duŋ zhin klik. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ŋgam tǝ sǝsǝk ndim ntǝ nyɛ bam nyɛ yik zhin ir keŋ ndi mta nyɛmɛ tǝm yik zhine ba, neme ba zhin tei na yik me ir keŋ ndi izhin bǝ yik me ba. Mte siksik kǝr ivǝh, ikyak akpa yi, te mfu ngɔŋ, ŋar akpa, te zor ne akpa, ter akpa, iyaŋ wɔ lɛ ben yaŋ vuŋ kpa. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Isǝsǝk muŋɔ yi mtǝ nyɛ Arik amuŋ atei gli tu muŋ azimɛ nǝ ti min, tena tǝ mfu ne atu abɛ lalɛ bǝn abǝ kuti ndi bane duŋ lalɛ iyi, yaŋ gli kpa tsetser,bǝn vu amba kɔ alulum kurɔ bǝn itsǝn mimin.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Gbaŋ atɔŋ yi klɛ atu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Itsin muŋ kǝŋe itei yi mkpaŋ kɛ ntar ndi Myɛ bǝn abɛ zhin. &lt;&lt;kɔte lɛ takɛ sɛ nɛ zhik kǝ bǝn aner ayaa kɔ atar ndi ne yik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Nga mne nka men gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ ndi mne yi ben abɛ zhin ne gar muŋ iyi yaa. Mtara blai ne yaŋa muŋ: Mtǝ ŋurkam bam ntei duŋ abɛ men lalɛ kɔ abaŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ zen lalɛ ba, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />ate yi ndi izhin wɔb te izhin bǝ zhi te Kristi abaŋ nga alɛmɛ. Kristi ba yaŋ klik ndi ai bɛ lɛ ben abɛ zhin ba, ama Yesɔ aklik ne miŋ min. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ndi abɛ zhi ka ilɛmɛ iyi amɛ, ne ŋun Yesɔ te kpaŋu nǝ kpɔk kuŋkun kǝ gen ne ayi aneshir, neme nɛyi tsitsir nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik. Neme, ne min kɛ zeu bata klik ba, fe ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik ta tei yi ben Yesɔ te naa zhin ndum. <verse eid="2CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Tsar zhin akpamin te tɔ ka izhin gli itanyɛmɛ min; tsar akpa min tɔ. Ba zhin ne zhi te Kristi Yesɔ ayi ne miŋ min ka?, Fe ayi anii duŋ izhin zhaku ne tsara. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />M zhɔk susun tǝ izhin tei yik te bata ne zhaku ne tsara ba. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ta ben Arik te kǝr izhin bǝ na kinuŋ mimin ba. Ba ki iyiŋ ndi aneshir abɛ yik te tane li tsara ba ama izhin bǝ na ki ndi iyi anenen kɔ ndi ta ne zhi te iklu aŋin iyime. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Tǝ bata tei na kinuŋ yi kyak lɛ kɛ zub ba, anaga yi lɛ didik ankyak. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ta nyɛr nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi bata te klik ba fe izhineba bǝ klik; fena iben mɔr ne atu amin te izhin bǝ yi ne mgbamgbaŋ. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Waŋa ayi ki ndi mne cɛr kiki yiŋɛ ne yaŋa muŋ, ndi mte nyɛ kǝr mbǝ nyɛ ne kɔr kɛ mfu ba, mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ne nǝm ne kɛ iyi kɛ mɛ zhin tǝ izhin bǝ flu, ba abɛ gbu zhin aŋa ba.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Fe zǝzaŋa, akpa amuŋ, se zhin ber nuŋ! Shur zhin ayi ne kiki iyi yaŋ klɛtu; wɔ zhin iben muŋ; ta nyɛmɛ nɛ akpa min; izhin bǝ yi nǝ sɔŋ kǝ sǝk. Fe inyɛr iye Arik ben isik maa bǝ yi bene bɛ zhin.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Izhin bǝ tǝk amunya nǝ ku asa ir kɛ amunya abǝ zǝ Arik. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Ita zhɔk iyi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, inyɛr ye Arik,bǝn binetu iyi Izhu Tsetser bǝ yi bǝne bɛzhin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>